<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-19T17:37:21.028Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 17:37:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has used drones to strike a livestock market, killing civilians, and also hit a site in West Kordofan that killed four civilians. RSF drones have attacked an artisanal gold mine in South Kordofan and a gold-mining area on the Egypt border, causing civilian casualties. A drone attack near a market in Khartoum killed dozens, while another near a southern Sudan market killed scores. These incidents show a widening of drone use against civilian economic sites, beyond the earlier focus on combatants. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/africa/20261019-drone-attack-near-southern-sudan-market-kills-scores&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/19/drone-attack-market-al-dibab-west-kordofan-sudan&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNYmZUOFV6R1kwcnRPdUxyeWlqWmNPRk1RZHQtY2lDLVpidkp0SEx6WXdaeF9xR0pxamIwaDRhaVp0WDE5Mm9Qekl3YzBhRkwxY2RVaEkxLWhKMlVkQ0hWSlRQS0pCNUdteXlpQXp6WkRHOXNvSEg2WDRRWTFZMFlEMGJiNUdKa01LajV5amFQRlZrck1xdll2cVY4aGQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
